{# 2. OUR JOURNEY #}
<section class="section" id="story">
  <div class="container split story">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Our journey</p>
      <h2>Built on experience, by people who work in the industry.</h2>
      <p>We started out managing e-hailing fleets. Working the industry every day, we saw how badly Cape Town needed a safe, reliable way to move people, and how chaotic the business behind it could be.</p>
      <p>So we built our own systems to run a fast-moving industry properly. Every tool we use today came from a real problem on the road, and every service we offer runs on them.</p>
      {# Parked: founders' photo and sign-off (Keon Smith & Mikell Van Der Linde) goes here once photos are taken. #}
    </div>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="tl-item"><span class="tl-year">2023</span><div><b>E-hailing fleet management</b><p>Where we started: cars, drivers and the day-to-day of a fast-moving industry.</p></div></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><span class="tl-year">2024</span><div><b>Our first system</b><p>Built in Google Sheets. Retro, but it put the whole fleet on one page.</p></div></div>
      <div class="tl-item"><span class="tl-year">2024</span><div><b>Corporate transport</b><p>Our second vertical: shift transport for Cape Town businesses.</p></div></div>
      <div class="tl-item now"><span class="tl-year">2026</span><div><b>Our own apps, more ways to move, and Convoi OS</b><p>Rider, driver and live ops apps. Events, private rides, tours and fleet branding. And the system behind it all, now available to other fleets.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 3. WHAT WE STAND FOR: company-wide values #}
<section class="section band-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we stand for</p>
    <h2>Four things we hold ourselves to, whoever you are.</h2>
    <p>For the people we drive, the companies we work with, the drivers who work with us and the partners we bring on.</p>
    <div class="steps" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">SAFE</div><h3>Everyone gets home</h3><p>Vetted drivers, a code checked at every pickup and every trip tracked, for riders, guests and drivers alike.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">STRAIGHT</div><h3>No surprises</h3><p>Fixed prices before you book, invoices that match what ran, and any extra explained first.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">FAIR</div><h3>Drivers know their numbers</h3><p>Every driver gets a weekly statement that shows exactly how their pay was worked out.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">OURS</div><h3>We use what we sell</h3><p>Every tool we offer runs our own fleet first. If it doesn't work for us, we don't sell it.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

